  "description": "<p>As a follow on to <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2732\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2732</a> the \"self\" link should include range information so that the resulting link should look as follows: <br/>\n &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/resource/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/resource/fcr:versions</a>&gt;<br/>\n ; rel=\"self\";type=\"application/link-format\"<br/>\n ; from=\"Tue, 20 Jun 2000 18:02:59 GMT\"<br/>\n ; until=\"Wed, 09 Apr 2008 20:30:51 GMT\",</p>\n\n<p>These extra parameters are specified in <a href=\"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7089#section-5.1.1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7089#section-5.1.1</a></p>\n\n<p>See: <a href=\"https://github.com/dbernstein/fcrepo4/blob/7cb27f4912e0c9f08c5f074f25fa5658964b18a8/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraVersioning.java#L277\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/dbernstein/fcrepo4/blob/7cb27f4912e0c9f08c5f074f25fa5658964b18a8/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/FedoraVersioning.java#L277</a></p>",
